    "chunk_text": "o\u00f0 hi ealle ofer hine ut beon agangen. \u00dea forh\u00e6fednysse h\u00e6bbe he swa lange & a \u00fea wisan \u00fee \u00feam bisceope & \u00fea ealdre \u00feynce, & \u00feam Be \u00fe\u00e6re frefrunge \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee hreowse\u00f0 heafodgylt. Endebyrdnys \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee de\u00f0 opene d\u00e6dbote \u00fe\u00e6t is: \u00feu underfoh hine on Wodnesd\u00e6g onforan Lencgten, & on \u00feone d\u00e6g sy he broht to \u00fe\u00e6re halgan cyrcan greadon; & \u00feonne he \u00fe\u00e6der geclypod cume to & se bisceop & se ealdor gebiddon for hine mid eallum gebro\u00f0rum, & gefrefion hine on \u00feone Be andytnyssum. Vs mana\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t halige gewrit & cwy\u00f0, Geopena Drihtne \u00feinne weg, & hiht on hine. Eft hit cwy\u00f0, Andytta\u00f0 Drihtne, for \u00feam geond worolde is his mildheortnys. Eft hit cwy\u00f0, Minne gylt ic dyde \u00fee cu\u00f0ne, & mine unrihtwysnysse ne behydde ic. Eac eft cwy\u00f0, Ic andytte ongen me Drihtne mine unrihtwysnysse; & \u00feu forgeafe \u00fea arleasnysse minre & eft, Andytta\u00f0 eow betweox eowre synna, & hi beo\u00f0 gedylogede. & an o\u00f0re stowe hit cwy\u00f0, Se \u00fee behyt his leahtras, ne bi\u00f0 he gerihtwysad; se \u00fee hi so\u00f0lice andytt, he & Drihten on his godspelle cw\u00e6\u00f0, Do\u00f0 d\u00e6dbote, so\u00f0lice heofena rice geneal\u00e6c\u00f0. Hit is neod, \u00feonne we fela \u00feurh deofles lare do\u00f0 ongean Godes wyllan & bebod, \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feurh so\u00f0e &",
